WEBVTT

00:12:29.542 --> 00:12:32.226
than scheduling pick-up and drop-off,

00:12:32.250 --> 00:12:34.059
playdates,

00:12:34.083 --> 00:12:37.184
deciding what he's going to wear,
what he's going to eat.

00:12:37.208 --> 00:12:40.226
For us, it's about helping
each other carry the weight,

00:12:40.250 --> 00:12:42.059
unpack the load,

00:12:42.083 --> 00:12:46.309
and to show up in the world
in a way that honors the beauty

00:12:46.333 --> 00:12:48.143
of our son.

00:12:48.167 --> 00:12:51.375
And it's for these reasons
that we do affirmations.

00:12:52.458 --> 00:12:54.893
ER: We never though we'd be here.

00:12:54.917 --> 00:12:56.434
But here we are.

00:12:56.458 --> 00:13:00.059
And we hope that the way
that we show up for Sekou